<body>
    <h1>Build config.json practice</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><strong>Background:</strong></p>
<p>when develop a new feature, which may need to add/delete in config.json<=
/p>
<p>to make this feature works, need to build the config.json to production =
before the app released;</p>
<p>Production config is controlled by NOC, need request them to build to pr=
oduction; So need to arrange the build schedule to request NOC to build</p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>Operation:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>create a ticket</p></li>
</ol>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://hongkongtv.atlassian.net/jira=
/software/projects/TWAPP/issues/TWAPP-169" rel=3D"nofollow">https://hongkon=
gtv.atlassian.net/jira/software/projects/TWAPP/issues/TWAPP-169</a></p>
<p></p>
<p>Green for Add</p>
<p>Red for Delete</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p>When to create the ticket?</p>
<p>when u start development, and updated config.json on dev config.json; th=
en create the ticket;</p>
<p>normally, when update dev=E2=80=99s config.json, update all env=E2=80=99=
s config.json;</p>
<p>For production, and apps-staging(pre-production), which cannot updated b=
y us, then create a ticket for it;</p>
<p></p>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>Due day reminder</p></li>
</ol>
<p>set a due day to build the config to reminder to build the config</p>
<p></p>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"https=
://app.asana.com/0/1205361179257126/overview" rel=3D"nofollow">https://app.=
asana.com/0/1205361179257126/overview</a></p><span class=3D"confluence-embe=
dded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-i=
mage image-center" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"d003b424126091b296741901abd0f1cb=
579612d9825798f5bfa839c23e953965" data-image-src=3D"https://hongkongtv.atla=
ssian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3615260732/Screenshot%202023-08-28%20at=
%2010.47.06%20AM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1693190831849&amp;c=
acheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"946" data-width=3D"1334" data-=
unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3657367970" data-=
linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data=
-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Screenshot 2023-08-28 at 10.47.06 AM.png"=
 data-base-url=3D"https://hongkongtv.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resour=
ce-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"36152607=
32" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" data-media-id=3D"dc5847c9=
-75f3-4e0a-8aed-297d967c710e" data-media-type=3D"file" width=3D"468" height=
=3D"331"></span>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Create a task</p></li>
<li>
<p>assign to <a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-account-id=
=3D"5b024ffd9e4c6005f411ec5b" href=3D"https://hongkongtv.atlassian.net/wiki=
/people/5b024ffd9e4c6005f411ec5b?ref=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_blank" data-l=
inked-resource-id=3D"652443775" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-lin=
ked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://hongkongtv.atlassia=
n.net/wiki">TW-App-Vincent Su</a></p></li>
<li>
<p>Set Due Date</p></li>
<li>
<p>Paste the ticket link</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<p><strong>For API Path key design principle:</strong></p>
<p>path key use value path;</p>
<p>domain key use domain value</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">"mercha=
nt_batch_billing": {
  "scheme": "https://",
  "domain": "merchant-batch-billing-api.shoalter.com/",
  "service": "mms-batch-billing/",
  "paths": {
    //...
    "sales_report": "api/v1/salesReport"
  }
},</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<p>after build on svn, create a build ticket <span class=3D"confluence-jim-=
macro jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D"BUILD-4157"> <a href=3D"https://hongkong=
tv.atlassian.net/browse/BUILD-4157" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"=
icon" src=3D"https://hongkongtv.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/v=
iew/type/issuetype/avatar/10318?size=3Dmedium">BUILD-4157</a> - <span class=
=3D"summary">Production Build - [App Config MMS Config] -2024-02-16-1400</s=
pan> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira=
-macro-single-issue-export-pdf">Deployed</span> </span></p>
<p>change status to Sanity Check</p>
<p>after verify, change status to Submit for Approval, and assign to herman=
 to approve;</p>
<p>after herman approve;</p>
<p>send message @ related noc staffs in slack #noc-devops</p>
<p>then wait noc take ticket and arrange deployment;</p>
<p>after deployment, production verify</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
